Reused components
-----------------

crates/augenmass-core is the data-minimisation and verification engine, reused
as-is from the Augenmaß / Klartext verifier project (also Apache-2.0). It is
HTTP-free and pure; this repository vendors it so the toolkit builds standalone.

The engine and the CLI depend on, among others:
- openid4vp (Spruce Systems) for the OpenID4VP / DCQL types
- ssi (Spruce Systems) for SD-JWT, JWK, and token-status-list primitives
- josekit (the cobward fork) for JWE / JOSE operations
- x509-cert, p256, sha2 for certificate and key handling

Test fixtures under fixtures/ are TEST ONLY material captured from local oracle
services (ERICA and EUDIPLO) and from deterministic generators. The included
keys are test keys; no production key material is committed. The private
status-list signing key is intentionally absent (only the public verification
key is included).
